in my head!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dr James: What do you mean?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carlson: These faces ,these monsters! Please just&lt;br /&gt;
let me die!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dr James: What are these &amp;quot;faces&amp;quot; of yours?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carlson: Look, I don&#039;t fucking know man, one day I.&lt;br /&gt;
just dreamed of my dead wife telling me a&lt;br /&gt;
date, and. now I&#039;m over here with this shit!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dr James: Alright now calm down, well continue.&lt;br /&gt;
talking about these &amp;quot;faces&amp;quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carlson: Alright what the hell do you want from me?&lt;/p&gt;
