				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5161</guid>
				<title>SCP-5161</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5161</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.ibb.co/XDV3VN4/5-CD9-AA45-E88-E-46-D7-905-A-15-F127439-ADD.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;5-CD9-AA45-E88-E-46-D7-905-A-15-F127439-ADD.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5161 at its discovery area&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5161&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5161 is to be kept in a glass casing suspended on metal locks inside of a semi-dimmed wooden containment chamber resembling a child’s “playroom”, At no point should SCP-5161 be taken out of its containment chamber.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5161 should be guarded by three level 2 guards at all times, and only level 2 personnel are permitted into SCP-5161,s containment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5161 is a wooden children’s toy more commonly known as “Cup-And-Ball” with a red circle on the top end of the “cup” with green and black lines of the outer end of the “cup.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5161 anomalous properties come into play when the user of SCP-5161 flips the toy upwards when it’s facing down, when the “ball” is falling it seems to land in the “cup” no matter which direction it is facing.&lt;br /&gt;
Testing results show that when the toy is damaged it will “steal” the users muscle mass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;log&amp;nbsp;A&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;log&amp;nbsp;A&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test log A - 4/23/2002&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-4557&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; D-4557 was instructed to flip SCP-5161 upside down&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results:&lt;/strong&gt; The “ball” landed in SCP-5161’s “cup”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Even while upside down its anomalous properties are not affected&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;log&amp;nbsp;B&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;–&amp;nbsp;hide&amp;nbsp;block&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test log B- 4/30/2002&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-8992&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; D-8992 was instructed to flip SCP-5161 while its “cup” is covered&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results:&lt;/strong&gt; The “ball” landed in SCP-5161’s “cup” while breaking the lid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Even while blocked its anomalous properties are not affected&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Test&amp;nbsp;log&amp;nbsp;C&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;–&amp;nbsp;hide&amp;nbsp;block&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test log C- 7/12/2002&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-1344&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedure:&lt;/strong&gt; D-1344 was instructed to damage SCP-5161&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results:&lt;/strong&gt; D-1344 reported a massive pain in his lower leg, the subject was examined and shown to have lost muscle mass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5161 can “steal” muscle mass if damaged&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coleton-richardson&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6358933&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609772998&quot; alt=&quot;Coleton richardson&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6358933)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coleton-richardson&quot;  &gt;Coleton richardson&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
