				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5171</guid>
				<title>SCP-5171</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5171</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5171/SCP-5171-2.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;SCP-5171-2.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An instance of SCP-5171-2.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5171&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5171 is to be blocked off from any civilian life, as are any public roads running through or by SCP-5171. In the event an instance of SCP-5171-2 crosses the threshold of SCP-5171, the instance is to be immediately terminated and disposed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the event an unauthorized civilian enters SCP-5171, retrieval teams are to be sent in to retrieve the civilian, which will then be administered amnestics and released.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5171 appears as a tunnel with a road running through it located under a bridge. The tunnel itself is a gateway to an area in between space and time, which is classified as SCP-5171-1. SCP-5171-1 appears to be infinite grasslands with a dirt road running through them. The weather inside SCP-5171-1 has been observed to always be raining, however the substance raining from the sky is not considered to be water. The substance raining from the sky inside of SCP-5171-1 appears to be a mixture of tears and blood. The origin of these substances is still unknown, as the clouds inside SCP-5171-1 are non-anomalous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5171-2 appear as humanoids that are attending a funeral, as they wear dark-colored clothing and are equipped with umbrellas. SCP-5171-2 appear to always be mourning, letting out low cries at all times. Instances of SCP-5171-2 are observed to be hostile when approached, letting out loud screams and cries while chasing down the person who approached them and attempting to attack them with the umbrella they are equipped with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The anatomies of SCP-5171-2 are the same as that of a normal human being&#039;s anatomy, meaning they can easily be terminated with firearms. SCP-5171-2 do not show any higher brain functions, nor the ability to communicate verbally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drpepperthepeeper&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7131235&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609772998&quot; alt=&quot;DrPepperThePeeper&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7131235)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drpepperthepeeper&quot;  &gt;DrPepperThePeeper&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
