>The anatomies of SCP-5171-2 are the same as that of a normal human being's anatomy, meaning they can easily be terminated with firearms. SCP-5171-2 do not show any higher brain functions, nor the ability to communicate verbally.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drpepperthepeeper" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7131235&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609772998" alt="DrPepperThePeeper" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7131235)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drpepperthepeeper" >DrPepperThePeeper</a></span></p> 
