				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5129</guid>
				<title>SCP-5129</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5129</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5129/SCP-5129&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-5129/SCP-5129/medium.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;SCP-5129&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5129 upon recovery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129 is to be housed in a secure locker at Site-19. Any personnel with Level 2 or higher clearance wishing to use SCP-5129 must first complete a full psychological evaluation, and be approved for usage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129 is a frog carved out of jade, measuring 10 centimeters in length and dated to be approximately 1000 years old. When in its inactive state, it displays no anomalous characteristics. Once activated by its intended user (SCP-5129-1), it begins to emit harmless levels of █████████ radiation, and air pressure within a 3 meter sphere drops to 27.50 Hg. SCP-5129-1 then telepathically hears a voice&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-53080-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; which is unanimously described as having a deep, booming quality. In every test to date, this voice has only been reported saying: &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;DO YOU WISH TO EMERGE?&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; If SCP-5129-1 declines, then SCP-5129 immediately returns to an inactive state.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If SCP-5129-1 accepts, they will feel an immense tingling sensation over their entire body, which is usually reported as being strongest in the head and the chest. This sensation lasts for between 30 to 40 minutes, after which point SCP-5129 returns to its inactive state. During this process, SCP-5129-1 undergoes a psychological rebalancing, which removes any urge or want for what previously was their greatest desire.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-53080-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; SCP-5129 may be used multiple times by the same instance of SCP-5129-1, removing an additional desire upon every use. However, each usage after the first has a high risk of causing severe neurological damage to SCP-5129-1, along with a slight chance of ████████ ██████████. Repeat useage of SCP-5129 is currently prohibited by Dr. E████.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5129 was first discovered in ███ ██ ███████, Yucatan, Mexico. It was being used by a local church, who offered to &amp;quot;Remove the sin&amp;quot; from anyone who requested. The local priest believed it to be a vessel of Jesus Christ, which the church had reportedly discovered at the bottom of a nearby cenote in 19██. Upon further investigation, Foundation Archeologist Dr. ███████ reported that the local Maya community identified it as being an idol of the Mayan Deity ████████████, which is believed to be an incarnation of [DATA EXPUNGED].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The activation ritual for SCP-5129 must be carried out in its entirety by SCP-5129-1, although they may receive verbal or written instruction from another source. SCP-5129 must first be placed into a layer of water between 1 and 2 centimeters deep. This water must originate from a spring, a natural well, or from collected rainwater.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-53080-3&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; Five tallow candles must then be arranged evenly around SCP-5129 and ignited. SCP-5129-1 must then add a single drop of their blood to the water. SCP-5129 activates exactly five seconds after the final step is completed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Testing&amp;nbsp;Logs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Testing&amp;nbsp;Logs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 01&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-3710&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; Money&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject no longer displays any attachment or interest to material wealth, beyond what is necessary for survival. It should be noted that the subject does not express an aversion to material wealth, and will accept it if instructed too. However their apathy towards the given object results in them losing it soon after. Subject still expresses a desire and interest for objects of sentimental value. Subject has since expressed interest in a self-sustaining agrarian lifestyle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Working as predicted. I find it intriguing that D-3710 lost interest in ALL material wealth, not just paper money. Something to look further into. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 02&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-3718&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; Sex&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject&#039;s views on sex changed to be consistent with asexuality. As with the previous subject, they demonstrated no great aversion to it, and in questioning stated that they would engage in sexual intercourse to produce offspring, or to please a partner, but they had no drive for it themselves. Unlike with the previous subject, they expressed unhappiness in this change in their personality, and became angry when their request to reverse the ritual was denied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;So it removes your desire, but not necessarily your desire for the desire. Odd. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 06&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-3740&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject has a strong addiction to heroin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; Heroin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject lost all interest towards heroin. Even when the drug was re-administered, it triggered no new addiction in them. Subject reported being overjoyed that &amp;quot;they were finally free.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As I&#039;d hoped, SCP-5129 shows great promise for treating addiction! I&#039;ll notify my superiors of the possibilities. Maybe this can help me squeeze a little more funding out of them. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 07&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. M██████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; After hearing of the success with D-3740, Dr. M██████ insisted that we cure their overbearance on alcohol, which allegedly has caused much difficulty with their personal relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I&#039;m wary of using SCP-5129 on foundation personnel at this early stage, but he went over my head on this one. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; Alcohol&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject&#039;s desire for alcohol went unchanged. Instead, they lost all drive or motivation to work or continue their research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[Expletive Removed] &lt;em&gt;idiot. I told him we needed to do more testing to make sure there were no risks, but nooooo. Still, I suppose I should be thankful, this told us a lot. If what you think your greatest desire is differs from what it actually is, SCP-5129 removes your actual one. Or more eloquently, it listens to your subconscious over your conscious mind. Dr. M██████ was always very dedicated to his work- I suppose that consumed his mind more strongly than his addiction. This does put a crimp in the practical applications of SCP-5129 though; we don&#039;t want to risk removing the wrong thing. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 16&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-3715&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject has been deprived of food for two days leading up to this test.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; Food&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject continued to have a strong urge to sate their hunger. Upon questioning, it was revealed that they no longer had any wish to start a family, something they&#039;d dreamt about for a considerable time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;So immediate survival needs do not override base desires. Got it. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 17&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; Former Dr. M██████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Well this is grim. They&#039;re making me run tests on my ex-colleague now. I only hope this won&#039;t end up being me a few years down the line. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; Alcohol&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject lost desire for alcohol.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Well there&#039;s a relief. This is the first time we&#039;ve used it more than once on the same person. According to the interview logs, the priest we took this from said only to use it once per person. Everything seemed to go alright though, although the tingling phase took considerably longer this time, almost 70 minutes. I wonder how many times it can be done on the same person. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 18&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; Former Dr. M██████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; A romantic partner&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; After only 10 minutes, subject experienced severe brain hemorrhaging, dying shortly after.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;That answers that. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 19&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-3721&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject suffers from eating disorder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; Food&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject lost most desire for food. While they still eat to nourish themselves, they will only eat the minimum of what they need to stay healthy, and have no particular care for flavor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Finally able to get back to this line of testing. It seems SCP-5129 will still leave survival instincts intact. Good to know, that&#039;s one less way things can go wrong. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEST 20&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; D-3721&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stated Desire:&lt;/strong&gt; Freedom&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject experienced similar negative effects as in Test 18, as well as experiencing a ███████ of the █████ and ███████████.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Well that was horrific. But this was only the second test&amp;#8230; maybe there&#039;s some neurological factor which determines resistance to repeat usage of SCP-5129? It would be prohibitively costly to find out, especially given the meager benefits. Besides, I don&#039;t exactly want to have to witness that ever again. We&#039;ll just assume it&#039;s a gamble whether it works or not on repeat rituals, and stick to one ritual per person from now on. -Dr. E████&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; After completing Test 50, I&#039;m finally approving SCP-5129 for general use among personnel. If you do need to use it, please don&#039;t try and throw your psych exams. Some of our desires can be pretty important to how we function. If the evaluator says no, that means NO. -Dr. E████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-53080-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. This voice always speaks in the first or preferred language of SCP-5129-1&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-53080-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. After experiencing this, one D-Class personnel who self-identified as Buddhist suggested that it was a method for detaching from the material world to reach enlightenment. To them, SCP-5129&#039;s question &amp;quot;Do you wish to emerge&amp;quot; was referring to this transition. Further testing has neither confirmed nor denied this theory.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-53080-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. The Priest stated that only holy water would activate SCP-5129. Further investigation confirmed that this belief stemmed from the fact that he collected water intended to be blessed from rainfall, while all his other water was drawn from an artificial well.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
